  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Social Dialogue for early Recovery and Rebuilding in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to a better functioning of the labour market through support to employers&#x2019; and workers&#x2019; organisations  capable of meeting the needs of repair, recovery and reconstruction in Ukraine during and after the war through social dialogue at local, sector and national level. Social partners in Ukraine actively contributes to securing the needed skills and competences for Ukraine to &#x201c;build back better&#x201d; and access to employment for internally displaced and people injured by the war through re- and upskilling.</narrative>
  </description>
